-accent/20 hover:text-foreground\">Mocha</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-accent/20 hover:text-foreground\">Cypress</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-accent/20 hover:text-foreground\">Postman</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-accent/20 hover:text-foreground\">Git</span><span class=\"rounded-md border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-2 py-0.5 font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:border-accent/20 hover:text-foreground\">GitHub</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 border-t border-border/40 bg-card/15\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-accent/50\"></span>How I Engineer</span><h2 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">From product idea to production.</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-lg\">A repeatable engineering process that moves from discovery to deployment without losing sight of the product.</p></div><div class=\"relative mt-12 lg:mt-16\"><div class=\"absolute left-[19px] top-0 h-full w-px bg-border/40 sm:left-[23px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></div><div class=\"absolute left-[19px] top-0 w-px bg-gradient-to-b from-accent to-accent/30 sm:left-[23px]\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"transform-origin:top;transform:scaleY(0)\"></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-6 lg:gap-8\"><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">01</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Discovery</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Understand the product goals, constraints, and users before writing a line of code — defining scope and success criteria.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">02</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Architecture</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Design application boundaries, data models, APIs, authentication, and infrastructure before unnecessary complexity accumulates.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">03</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Interface</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Build responsive, accessible React interfaces with reusable components and clear state management.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">04</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Backend</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Design APIs and business logic around maintainability, security, and performance.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">05</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Data</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Choose appropriate relational, document, caching, and realtime strategies for the workload.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">06</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Testing</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Validate behavior with unit, integration, and end-to-end tests alongside performance checks.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">07</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Deployment</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Containerization, CI/CD, cloud infrastructure, performance, and production readiness.</p></div></div><div class=\"relative pl-12 sm:pl-16\" style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><span class=\"absolute left-0 top-0 flex h-10 w-10 items-center justify-center rounded-lg border border-border/60 bg-card font-mono text-sm font-semibold text-accent sm:h-12 sm:w-12\">08</span><div class=\"pt-1\"><h3 class=\"text-base font-semibold text-foreground sm:text-lg\">Iteration</h3><p class=\"mt-2 max-w-xl text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-base\">Monitor, measure, and refine based on real usage — shipping improvements continuously.</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"about\" class=\"relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 border-t border-border/40 bg-card/15\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-7\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-accent/50\"></span>About</span><h2 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">An engineer who understands the whole system.</h2></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"mt-6 space-y-4 text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty\"><p>I&#x27;m a full-stack software engineer who enjoys understanding the entire system rather than working at a single layer. My experience spans frontend, backend, databases, mobile, cloud, and automation — taking products from concept through production.</p><p>I care about architecture decisions, data modeling, and the tradeoffs that make software maintainable over time. Whether it&#x27;s a React interface, a Node.js API, or a cloud deployment pipeline, I build with the full picture in mind.</p></div><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3 text-accent\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Frontend</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3 text-accent\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Backend</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3 text-accent\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Databases</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3 text-accent\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Mobile</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3 text-accent\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Cloud</span><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 rounded-full border border-border/50 bg-secondary/20 px-3 py-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-code-xml h-3 w-3 text-accent\"><path d=\"m18 16 4-4-4-4\"></path><path d=\"m6 8-4 4 4 4\"></path><path d=\"m14.5 4-5 16\"></path></svg>Automation</span></div></div></div><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"rounded-xl border border-border/40 bg-card/40 p-6\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-graduation-cap h-4 w-4 text-accent\"><path d=\"M21.42 10.922a1 1 0 0 0-.019-1.838L12.83 5.18a2 2 0 0 0-1.66 0L2.6 9.08a1 1 0 0 0 0 1.832l8.57 3.908a2 2 0 0 0 1.66 0z\"></path><path d=\"M22 10v6\"></path><path d=\"M6 12.5V16a6 3 0 0 0 12 0v-3.5\"></path></svg>Education</h3><div class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">Technion</span><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground\">2018 — 2021</span></div><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Practical Software Engineering Diploma</span><span class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground/80 text-pretty\">Graduated with Excellence. Final project: &quot;Teach Me&quot; — a cross-platform tutoring application built with Flutter and Firebase.</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-1\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-3\"><span class=\"text-sm font-semibold text-foreground\">ITSafe Cyber College</span><span class=\"font-mono text-xs text-muted-foreground\">2021</span></div><span class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Cybersecurity Diploma</span><span class=\"mt-1 text-xs leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground/80 text-pretty\">Focused on application security, threat modeling, and defensive engineering practices.</span></div></div></div><div class=\"mt-5 rounded-xl border border-border/40 bg-card/40 p-6\"><h3 class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe h-4 w-4 text-accent\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg>Languages</h3><div class=\"mt-4 flex flex-col gap-3\"><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">Arabic</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Native</span></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">English</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Professional</span></div><div class=\"flex items-baseline justify-between gap-4\"><span class=\"text-sm text-foreground\">Hebrew</span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">Fluent</span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"github\" class=\"relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 border-t border-border/40\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-accent/50\"></span>Open Source</span><h2 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">Code on GitHub.</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-lg\">Selected repositories and code. Structured for live GitHub API integration.</p></div><div class=\"mt-12 grid grid-cols-1 gap-5 lg:mt-16 md:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-6\"><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ameerjawa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"group flex h-full flex-col rounded-xl border border-border/40 bg-card/30 p-6 transition-all duration-300 hover:border-accent/20 hover:bg-card/50\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-github h-5 w-5 text-accent\"><path d=\"M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4\"></path><path d=\"M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2\"></path></svg><h3 class=\"font-mono text-base font-semibold text-foreground\">ameerjawa</h3></div><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-up-right h-4 w-4 text-muted-foreground transition-all group-hover:text-accent group-hover:translate-x-0.5 group-hover:-translate-y-0.5\"><path d=\"M7 7h10v10\"></path><path d=\"M7 17 17 7\"></path></svg></div><p class=\"mt-3 flex-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty\">Personal portfolio — Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Framer Motion.</p><div class=\"mt-5 flex items-center gap-4 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5\"><span class=\"h-2.5 w-2.5 rounded-full bg-accent\"></span>TypeScript</span></div></a></div></div><div class=\"mt-12 flex justify-center\"><a href=\"https://github.com/ameerjawa\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium ring-offset-background transition-all focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-ring focus-visible:ring-offset-2 disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 border border-input bg-background hover:bg-accent/10 hover:border-accent/40 hover:text-foreground h-11 rounded-md px-8\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-github h-4 w-4\"><path d=\"M15 22v-4a4.8 4.8 0 0 0-1-3.5c3 0 6-2 6-5.5.08-1.25-.27-2.48-1-3.5.28-1.15.28-2.35 0-3.5 0 0-1 0-3 1.5-2.64-.5-5.36-.5-8 0C6 2 5 2 5 2c-.3 1.15-.3 2.35 0 3.5A5.403 5.403 0 0 0 4 9c0 3.5 3 5.5 6 5.5-.39.49-.68 1.05-.85 1.65-.17.6-.22 1.23-.15 1.85v4\"></path><path d=\"M9 18c-4.51 2-5-2-7-2\"></path></svg>Explore GitHub</a></div></div></section><section id=\"contact\" class=\"relative py-20 sm:py-28 lg:py-32 border-t border-border/40\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-full max-w-6xl px-5 sm:px-8\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-16\"><div class=\"lg:col-span-5\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-4\"><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-mono uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-accent\"><span class=\"h-px w-8 bg-accent/50\"></span>Contact</span><h2 class=\"max-w-3xl text-3xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground text-balance sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl\">Building the next thing?</h2><p class=\"max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground text-pretty sm:text-lg\">I&#x27;m open to software engineering opportunities where I can contribute across product, frontend, backend, and infrastructure.</p></div><div style=\"opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)\"><div class=\"mt-8 flex flex-col gap-2.5\"><a href=\"mailto:ameer0233@gmail.com\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail h-4 w-4 text-accent\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg>ameer0233@gmail.com</a><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/in/ameer-jawabra-730a62191/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-muted-foreground transition-colors hover:text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-linkedin h-4 w-4 text-accent\"><path d=\"M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z\"></path><rect width=\"4\" height=\"12